{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581260/extras/c4fea37c62f47f467c623921f006ea23.poster.avif?t=1763544625\" width=1170 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581260/extras/c4fea37c62f47f467c623921f006ea23.webm?t=1763544625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put yourself together (literally) to attend a series of monster ballrooms, each with its own myth-inspired boss and decor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix &amp; match body parts, embody different themes, and win over picky judges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your character\u2014and your own style.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581260/extras/94f7b37886eb7ad36ee356e2d789ea09.poster.avif?t=1763544625\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581260/extras/94f7b37886eb7ad36ee356e2d789ea09.webm?t=1763544625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581260/extras/94f7b37886eb7ad36ee356e2d789ea09.mp4?t=1763544625\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581260/extras/0653d26af31ffb24d915b9e26874a1f0.poster.avif?t=1763544625\" width=1170 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581260/extras/0653d26af31ffb24d915b9e26874a1f0.webm?t=1763544625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the foreign world, play minigames to design blueprints, or gather materials</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft a vast wardrobe of phantom limbs, skeletal wings, and clockwork hearts.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581260/extras/bfa054af1e6e0d7e05b2e17833a1af6b.poster.avif?t=1763544625\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581260/extras/bfa054af1e6e0d7e05b2e17833a1af6b.webm?t=1763544625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581260/extras/bfa054af1e6e0d7e05b2e17833a1af6b.mp4?t=1763544625\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581260/extras/971c689dfc843bd8d9e43da8da466479.poster.avif?t=1763544625\" width=1170 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581260/extras/971c689dfc843bd8d9e43da8da466479.webm?t=1763544625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make yourself at home in the monster world: live, grow, dream, hang out with friends, and go on dates;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb up the ballroom rankings, light up your skill tree, and create hundreds of pieces of glamorous &amp; monstrous body parts to complete your collection;</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581260/extras/330a4b1451d7eda94146dde7f1859526.poster.avif?t=1763544625\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581260/extras/330a4b1451d7eda94146dde7f1859526.webm?t=1763544625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581260/extras/330a4b1451d7eda94146dde7f1859526.mp4?t=1763544625\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581260/extras/0f0d2f99fc80ce937fbc73dd936e849c.poster.avif?t=1763544625\" width=1170 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581260/extras/0f0d2f99fc80ce937fbc73dd936e849c.webm?t=1763544625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Thea, a plastic surgeon who fell headfirst into a world of monsters &amp; myths.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey with your unlikely ally Winks, a not-so-bright monster who dreams of eating human flesh. Can a genuine friendship arise while you try to keep your human identity hidden?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Impress, befriend, and romance mythical monsters, uncover their pasts and secrets.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3581260?t=1763544625","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581260/266e56c239efa47e709e174189142a47e0bc2fbf/page_b